but because right now in the UK and just,

01:27:30.990 --> 01:27:32.010
I guess everywhere in the world,

01:27:32.010 --> 01:27:33.330
it's wedding craze right now

01:27:33.330 --> 01:27:35.830
because we're approaching
the end of the pandemic,

01:27:36.930 --> 01:27:38.794
they were all booked up.

01:27:38.794 --> 01:27:41.100
So Garnt messaged me a few days

01:27:41.100 --> 01:27:43.027
before I was about to
fly out to UK being like,

01:27:43.027 --> 01:27:47.317
"Hey, so sorry, but I wasn't
able to get your suit rental

01:27:47.317 --> 01:27:49.440
"so you're gonna have
to bring your own suit."

01:27:49.440 --> 01:27:53.820
And I was like, "okay, I
only have a JoJo suit."

01:27:53.820 --> 01:27:54.653
- I mean, that's fine.

01:27:54.653 --> 01:27:55.486
That's not a problem.

01:27:55.486 --> 01:27:56.545
- Which was okay.

01:27:56.545 --> 01:27:58.387
So I was like, "Whatever, I'll
just get that dry cleaned,

01:27:58.387 --> 01:27:59.610
"wear it, whatever."

01:27:59.610 --> 01:28:01.500
But then when I got to London

01:28:01.500 --> 01:28:03.487
and I was sorting out
my luggage, I was like,

01:28:03.487 --> 01:28:07.377
"Shit, I forgot to bring my suit shoes."

01:28:08.220 --> 01:28:09.997
And so in the back of my head, I was like,

01:28:09.997 --> 01:28:12.067
"Well, I'm in London for an entire week.

01:28:12.067 --> 01:28:14.227
"I'll just pop over to a shoe store,

01:28:14.227 --> 01:28:15.507
"buy some nice shoes."

01:28:16.620 --> 01:28:18.453
I got a little bit ham in London.

01:28:19.986 --> 01:28:21.330
I was drinking every day in London

01:28:21.330 --> 01:28:22.976
because of course you do,

01:28:22.976 --> 01:28:25.140
meeting up, catching up
with a bunch of people.

01:28:25.140 --> 01:28:27.480
So the morning of the wedding

01:28:27.480 --> 01:28:29.520
as I was taking my suit out,

01:28:29.520 --> 01:28:32.610
I realized I don't have suit shoes.

01:28:32.610 --> 01:28:36.120
And the only pair of
shoes I had were a Vessis

01:28:36.120 --> 01:28:37.770
that I was wearing.

01:28:37.770 --> 01:28:41.680
So I rocked up to the
wedding in full suit,

01:28:41.680 --> 01:28:45.510
tie pin, belt, everything
and a pair of Vessis.

01:28:45.510 --> 01:28:48.903
And everyone at the
wedding was giving me shit.

01:28:50.490 --> 01:28:51.787
They were literally doing the,

01:28:51.787 --> 01:28:52.707
"What are those?"

01:28:55.290 --> 01:28:57.190
Fully deserved mind you,

01:28:57.190 --> 01:29:00.630
but you know what, at
the end of the day I won

01:29:00.630 --> 01:29:03.210
because when I got onto
that dance floor, dude,

01:29:03.210 --> 01:29:04.470
I was fully prepared.

01:29:04.470 --> 01:29:06.480
I was fully prepared with my Vessis.

01:29:06.480 --> 01:29:08.790
Everyone had taken their
shoes off to dance.

01:29:08.790 --> 01:29:11.390
I was like, "Step aside, I
got the footwear for it."

01:29:12.900 --> 01:29:14.430
Don't do that.

01:29:14.430 --> 01:29:16.530
Bring proper suit shoes.

01:29:16.530 --> 01:29:17.380
- [Connor] You had one job, Joey.

01:29:17.380 --> 01:29:20.520
- I had one job to buy suit
shoes and I did not fulfill it.

01:29:20.520 --> 01:29:22.573
- It's making a statement
there, making a statement.

01:29:22.573 --> 01:29:23.940
- Yeah, exactly, I was making a statement.

01:29:23.940 --> 01:29:26.643
- But I guess wedding aside,

01:29:27.600 --> 01:29:32.550
I guess it was a reasonable
amount of time in the UK.

01:29:32.550 --> 01:29:33.560
I feel like you got to experience more

01:29:33.560 --> 01:29:34.980
of the UK this time as well.

01:29:34.980 --> 01:29:37.110
- Yeah, absolutely, I mean,
last time I was in the UK,

01:29:37.110 --> 01:29:40.020
which was the first time
was we were staying mostly

01:29:40.020 --> 01:29:41.490
at your place in Brighton.

01:29:41.490 --> 01:29:45.570
So I think we were only in
London for maybe two days.

01:29:45.570 --> 01:29:47.880
And even then, it was mostly just going

01:29:47.880 --> 01:29:51.360
to all of the touristy places and whatnot.

01:29:51.360 --> 01:29:52.920
So I think, yeah, this time around,

01:29:52.920 --> 01:29:56.220
not only did I get to have a proper view

01:29:56.220 --> 01:30:01.220
of London, London, but also
like Chris took me out of London

01:30:01.290 --> 01:30:04.380
as well 'cause we went
filming to a bunch of places

01:30:04.380 --> 01:30:07.110
and I actually got to see
the country side of London.

01:30:07.110 --> 01:30:08.610
I got to see Stonehenge.

01:30:08.610 --> 01:30:09.443
- Oh, did you actually?

01:30:09.443 --> 01:30:10.620
- Yeah, we went to Stonehenge.

01:30:10.620 --> 01:30:12.094
- It's really disappointing, isn't it?

01:30:12.094 --> 01:30:15.183
- Yeah, it looks way
cooler from a distance.

01:30:16.530 --> 01:30:18.060
So to get to Stonehenge,

01:30:18.060 --> 01:30:20.280
you have to go to this visitor center,

01:30:20.280 --> 01:30:22.620
buy a ticket for some fucking reason

01:30:22.620 --> 01:30:25.290
and then you can either take a bus,

01:30:25.290 --> 01:30:26.850
which is five minutes to Stonehenge

01:30:26.850 --> 01:30:30.930
or you can walk across
the fields for 30 minutes.

01:30:30.930 --> 01:30:32.407
And I was like, "Well,
it's kind of a nice day.

01:30:32.407 --> 01:30:34.297
"Let's just walk across the fields

01:30:34.297 --> 01:30:36.090
"'cause it might be nice."

01:30:36.090 --> 01:30:40.042
It was not nice because
it was not only nothing

01:30:40.042 --> 01:30:41.340
for 30 minutes,

01:30:41.340 --> 01:30:44.370
but there was also just
horse shit everywhere.

01:30:44.370 --> 01:30:49.200
So I'm fucking dodging this horse shit

01:30:49.200 --> 01:30:50.280
because God forbid,

01:30:50.280 --> 01:30:52.904
these are the only pair of
fucking shoes I have as well.

01:30:52.904 --> 01:30:53.924
- Your Vessis, man.

01:30:53.924 --> 01:30:55.087
- Yes, I was wearing the Vessis.

01:30:55.087 --> 01:30:56.696
- No wonder why I smell shit.

01:30:56.696 --> 01:30:58.302
- I was like, "No, I have to
wear these in the wedding.

01:30:58.302 --> 01:31:00.137
"I'm not having horse shit on these."

01:31:00.137 --> 01:31:02.760
So we got to it and then I guess

01:31:02.760 --> 01:31:05.520
because there was like an
incident some years ago

01:31:05.520 --> 01:31:10.270
of some drawing shit on
the Stonehenge stones

01:31:11.220 --> 01:31:14.265
so they had actually fenced it off,

01:31:14.265 --> 01:31:17.490
but they had fenced it off
not really an arms reach away,

01:31:17.490 --> 01:31:20.280
but at least about a 100 meters away.

01:31:20.280 --> 01:31:21.330
So the closest you could get

01:31:21.330 --> 01:31:23.430
to Stonehenge was 100 meters away,

01:31:23.430 --> 01:31:28.080
which was kind of defeating
the purpose I guess

01:31:28.080 --> 01:31:29.280
because apparently you used to be able

01:31:29.280 --> 01:31:31.650
to actually walk into Stonehenge

01:31:31.650 --> 01:31:32.847
and actually get like a view of it.

01:31:32.847 --> 01:31:34.373
You can't do that anymore

01:31:34.373 --> 01:31:37.173
because I guess some people
just ruined it for everyone,

01:31:38.040 --> 01:31:42.420
which was kind of underwhelming,
I guess in a sense,

01:31:42.420 --> 01:31:46.567
but I was like, "Well, Stonehenge
is that one heritage site

01:31:46.567 --> 01:31:48.007
"that you hear people talking about

01:31:48.007 --> 01:31:49.373
"and it's a hot tourist place."

01:31:49.373 --> 01:31:50.206
- [Connor] Just weird.

01:31:50.206 --> 01:31:51.039
- So I was just like,
"Well, you know what,

01:31:51.039 --> 01:31:53.430
"at least now I can say
that I've seen Stonehenge."

01:31:53.430 --> 01:31:57.960
But was it fascinating necessarily?

01:31:57.960 --> 01:31:58.950
Not really.

01:31:58.950 --> 01:32:01.123
- I'd go to a Greggs
any day over Stonehenge.

01:32:01.123 --> 01:32:02.523
- I mean, we did afterwards.

01:32:03.660 --> 01:32:04.650
We went to a Greggs afterwards,

01:32:04.650 --> 01:32:06.860
but I think the most enjoyment I had

01:32:06.860 --> 01:32:09.690
