see the real side of the UK,

01:32:13.890 --> 01:32:15.180
the actual countryside.

01:32:15.180 --> 01:32:19.724
We went past all these really
small, quaint little villages.

01:32:19.724 --> 01:32:21.540
There were some villages
that we drove past

01:32:21.540 --> 01:32:24.090
that legitimately looked like RPGs.

01:32:24.090 --> 01:32:27.900
It was like an RPG medieval
town, which was so fucking cool.

01:32:27.900 --> 01:32:28.733
- That's most of the UK.

01:32:28.733 --> 01:32:31.127
- Right, but I had never seen that before

01:32:31.127 --> 01:32:34.440
