01:32:38.600 --> 01:32:41.070
in these really small,
quaint villages to be like,

01:32:41.070 --> 01:32:43.380
oh, we got like the full
experience of the UK.

01:32:43.380 --> 01:32:48.380
One of the best fucking
stories was we stopped by.

01:32:48.851 --> 01:32:51.383
I was dying for a piss.

01:32:51.383 --> 01:32:54.837
And so I was like, "We
have to stop by somewhere."

01:32:54.837 --> 01:32:57.059
But we're in the middle of nowhere.

01:32:57.059 --> 01:32:57.892
So we're like, oh, okay,

01:32:57.892 --> 01:33:00.360
I guess we'll just stop by
the closest village to see

01:33:00.360 --> 01:33:03.720
if there's an establishment we can borrow.

01:33:03.720 --> 01:33:05.100
So we stopped by this village.

01:33:05.100 --> 01:33:06.570
I don't even remember
the name of this village.

01:33:06.570 --> 01:33:07.950
It's fucking tiny.

01:33:07.950 --> 01:33:10.710
