across this road, okay?"

01:33:31.590 --> 01:33:33.443
And we're like, "A duck race?"

01:33:34.575 --> 01:33:35.408
- A duck race.

01:33:35.408 --> 01:33:38.940
- And sure enough, we
drive maybe about 50 meters

