do with your free time?

01:33:52.273 --> 01:33:55.170
- Yeah and I was like, "I
wanna be there at that age."

01:33:55.170 --> 01:33:57.217
I wanna just like wake up
in the morning and be like,

01:33:57.217 --> 01:33:58.560
"Oh, the duck race is today."

01:33:58.560 --> 01:34:01.170
And just go down some of my local pond

01:34:01.170 --> 01:34:02.613
