01:34:18.750 --> 01:34:21.235
it was in a town that you could walk

01:34:21.235 --> 01:34:24.060
from one end to the other in
about 30 minutes, I think.

01:34:24.060 --> 01:34:25.057
- Yeah, it was fucking tiny.
- It was fucking tiny.

01:34:25.057 --> 01:34:26.907
