'cause I Googled it.

01:34:47.873 --> 01:34:49.053
I was curious.

01:34:49.053 --> 01:34:50.640
You throw the pea.

01:34:50.640 --> 01:34:52.020
This is gonna tell them
wherever your wedding was

01:34:52.020 --> 01:34:52.853
by the way.

01:34:52.853 --> 01:34:53.686
It's only in this place.

01:34:53.686 --> 01:34:55.773
